      {
        "factor": "CDU lead and AfD around 18-20% in latest Baden-Württemberg polls",
        "direction": "down",
        "magnitude": "strong",
        "rationale": "February 2026 Infratest dimap polls place CDU ~28–29%, Greens ~23–27%, AfD ~18–20%, lifting the bar for AfD to become largest party and thus pushing probability toward 0.01 after updates."
