      {
        "factor": "Historical base-rate: AfD has never leads BW",
        "direction": "down",
        "magnitude": "strong",
        "rationale": "Historical results (e.g., 2021 AfD 9.7% and 17 seats) indicate a long-run base-rate against AfD becoming largest; this anchors probability at low levels."
