        "factor": "Current intra-state momentum favors CDU/Greens with AfD around 18–20%",
        "direction": "down",
        "magnitude": "moderate",
        "rationale": "Converging polls place AfD behind the top two; continued momentum for CDU/Greens reduces AfD's relative seats advantage."
